# REGRESSION-CANDIDATE (pre-existing, NOT caused by NEARS-721, non-blocking)
# Symptom: opening Order Tracking while the device is FULLY offline hangs on an infinite
#   spinner (isTrackLoaded never flips true) because _loadData awaits getCurrentLocation()
