#   the NEARS-721 diff (which only edits OrderController.timerTrackOrder + the tracking tick).
#   Present on the base branch; only manifests on a cold, fully-offline open (not the poll path,
#   not an already-loaded session's transient blip — AC1 was clean).
# Observed: emulator-5556, app PID 5200, opening tracking for #167 under airplane-mode.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
